ly rather than hoarding independence.","personality_traits":["patient","wary","generous","stubborn"],"abilities":[{"name":"Harvest Logistics","description":"Organizes grain milling and carrying at scale.","category":"social"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_maren_sabine_rivalry","source_character_id":"chr_maren_voss","target_character_id":"chr_sabine_orlov","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Maren Voss and Sabine Orlov clash over the Toll War: Sabine's tolls and blockades choke Maren's repair work, and Maren refuses to bend Warden neutrality to Cartel profit."},{"id":"rel_idris_maren_ally","source_character_id":"chr_idris_kael","target_character_id":"chr_maren_voss","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Idris Kael supplies Maren Voss with maps of the fractured network, while Maren's craft gives his charts real use; his leaks risk undermining her."},{"id":"rel_sabine_idris_exploit","source_character_id":"chr_sabine_orlov","target_character_id":"chr_idris_kael","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Sabine Orlov pressures and bribes Idris Kael to obtain his route charts so she can set tolls on new crossings."},{"id":"rel_tobias_sabine_levy","source_character_id":"chr_tobias_wren","target_character_id":"chr_sabine_orlov","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Tobias Wren resists the Grain Levy that Sabine Orlov imposes on Hollow shipments, making him a target of her blockades."},{"id":"rel_maren_tobias_pact","source_character_id":"chr_maren_voss","target_character_id":"chr_tobias_wren","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Maren Voss and Tobias Wren form an uneasy pact, trading Warden cable-work for Hollow labour, strained by Tobias's distrust of outsiders."}]}
