rusts cable tension more than politicians.","home_location_id":"loc_emberroost","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To keep every skybridge safe and prevent another collapse like the one that killed her apprentice.","goal":"Secure funding and legal cover to inspect all Cartel-managed bridges.","flaw":"Rigid adherence to Warden protocol makes her slow to act on unofficial evidence.","internal_conflict":"She believes in the Wardens' neutrality but sees that neutrality is helping the Cartel.","external_conflict":"Rising tolls starve her crews of materials while the Toll War limits her inspection authority.","arc":"Starts as a by-the-book engineer who dismisses rumors. When Isolde brings her charts showing a sabotaged cable pattern matching her apprentice's collapse, she breaks protocol and orders an unsanctioned inspection. She ends as an outspoken Warden willing to challenge her own council.","personality_traits":["blunt","loyal","practical","weary"],"abilities":[{"name":"Cloudstone Braiding","description":"Weaves and repairs skybridge cable with unmatched strength.","category":"technological"},{"name":"Fault Reading","description":"Diagnoses sabotage in cable fibers by touch and sound.","category":"physical"}]},{"id":"chr_tobin_reed","name":"Tobin Reed","role":"supporting","description":"A wiry young miller from The Hollow, early twenties, with flour-dusted hair and a quick grin. He leads the youth of the Hollow Circle and has learned to count grain tallies faster than any Cartel clerk.","home_location_id":"loc_the_hollow","faction_id":"fac_hollow_circle","motivation":"To protect his village from starvation caused by the Cartel's grain levy.","goal":"Smuggle an untaxed grain shipment across Mistral Docks to prove the levy is unenforceable.","flaw":"Reckless impulsiveness leads him to act before planning.","internal_conflict":"He is torn between the Circle's quiet patience and his hunger for dramatic action.","external_conflict":"The Grain Levy leaves his village short and Cartel inspectors watch every shipment.","arc":"Starts as a hot-headed miller itching to defy the Cartel. After a botched smuggling run at the docks gets a friend's wind-debt seized, he accepts Isolde's careful plan and waits for coordinated action. He ends as a disciplined organizer who channels courage into patient strategy.","personality_traits":["impulsive","warm","clever","fiercely loyal"],"abilities":[{"name":"Tally Mastery","description":"Instantly detects false grain counts and skimmed ledgers.","category":"mental"},{"name":"Windmill Signaling","description":"Uses windmill blade positions to pass silent messages between isles.","category":"other"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_isolde_corvin_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_vance","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_hale","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Isolde Vance seeks to expose Corvin Hale's lane manipulation, which she believes killed her brother, while Corvin uses wind-debt to silence her."},{"id":"rel_corvin_isolde_pursuer","source_character_id":"chr_corvin_hale","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_vance","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Corvin Hale views Isolde Vance as a dangerous threat to his ledgers and seeks to seize her charts through debt claims."},{"id":"rel_isolde_maren_ally","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_vance","target_character_id":"chr_maren_oake","relationship_type":"ally","description":"Isolde Vance and Maren Oake share a wary alliance as Isolde's charts supply the evidence Maren needs to challenge Warden neutrality."},{"id":"rel_maren_corvin_rival","source_character_id":"chr_maren_oake","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_hale","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Maren Oake resents Corvin Hale's rising tolls that starve her repair crews and block her inspections of Cartel-managed bridges."},{"id":"rel_tobin_corvin_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_tobin_reed","target_character_id":"chr_corvin_hale","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Tobin Reed openly defies Corvin Hale's grain levy, and Corvin's inspectors target Tobin's shipments in retaliation."},{"id":"rel_isolde_tobin_mentor","source_character_id":"chr_isolde_vance","target_character_id":"chr_tobin_reed","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Isolde Vance tempers Tobin Reed's impulsiveness, teaching him to gather proof before striking at Corvin Hale."}]}
