n that leak lets Marisol's agents find Isolde, Tamsin owns the mistake and publicly argues for Isolde's right to choose her own path. She ends as a more careful but still loyal ally.","personality_traits":["warm","impulsive","loyal","talkative"],"abilities":[{"name":"Windmill Lore","description":"She knows how to read the winds and keep grain mills running.","category":"other"},{"name":"Easy Rapport","description":"She quickly befriends strangers of any faction.","category":"social"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_isolde_corvin_mentor","source_character_id":"chr_corvin_ashgrove","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_vane","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Corvin Ashgrove is Isolde Vane's reluctant mentor. He distrusts her unmeasurable gift and forbids her from the failing bridge, which sets up the tension between them."},{"id":"rel_marisol_isolde_pursuer","source_character_id":"chr_marisol_drake","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_vane","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Marisol Drake pursues Isolde Vane to bind her to a Cartel contract, which would turn Isolde's gift into a tool for the Toll War."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_isolde_friend","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reed","target_character_id":"chr_isolde_vane","relationship_type":"friend","description":"Tamsin Reed is Isolde Vane's closest friend. Her loyalty and her careless leak of Isolde's secret put Isolde in Marisol's path."},{"id":"rel_corvin_marisol_rival","source_character_id":"chr_corvin_ashgrove","target_character_id":"chr_marisol_drake","relationship_type":"rival","description":"Corvin Ashgrove and Marisol Drake are bitter rivals in the Toll War, which pits the Wardens' bridge upkeep against the Cartel's rising tolls."},{"id":"rel_tamsin_marisol_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_tamsin_reed","target_character_id":"chr_marisol_drake","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Tamsin Reed opposes Marisol Drake because of the Cartel's Grain Levy on the Hollow Circle, which drives Tamsin to seek 